+/*!
+Exposes an Arrow-collected query result (produced by executing a pending result from
+`duckdb_pending_prepared_arrow`) as an Arrow C stream interface `ArrowArrayStream`. Ownership of the collected record
+batches moves into the stream: the stream stays valid after the result is destroyed, and the result yields no further
+data. The caller must release the stream via `out_stream->release(out_stream)` when done.
+
+* @param result The result to consume. Must have been produced by `duckdb_pending_prepared_arrow`.
+* @param out_stream The output stream structure to fill.
+* @return The error data. Must be destroyed with `duckdb_destroy_error_data`.
+*/
+DUCKDB_C_API duckdb_error_data duckdb_result_arrow_array_stream(duckdb_result *result,
